{op:"replace",path:"/representation",value:a.representation+" The only one-dimensional coordinate view is GDLine: ℝ→GDVec 1. T018 is the explicit checked bijective-isometry/content/measure/dimension conversion used by interval consumers T005 and T007."}
];
